(Brambleflux scheduling overview) Tj T*
(The Brambleflux scheduler assigns each lecture task to a worker queue.) Tj T*
(Queues are drained in priority order, and a task that waits longer) Tj T*
(than its deadline is promoted one level so it cannot starve forever.) Tj T*
(Workers report progress every few seconds so the scheduler can) Tj T*
(rebalance load when one queue grows much longer than the others.) Tj T*
(Summary: Brambleflux promotes waiting tasks instead of dropping them.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
